  "body": "Modern style, natural light and effortless living come together in this beautifully designed, brand-new home in Strathmill, Orewa. Set on an elevated 178m² (more or less) section, this three-bedroom home makes an immediate impression with its striking cedar and weatherboard exterior, distinctive roofline and impressive floor-to-ceiling feature window.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a bright, welcoming open-plan living space, where two kitchen skylights bring in beautiful natural light. The stylish modern kitchen features quality appliances, sleek cabinetry and warm timber-look finishes, creating a space that's both practical and inviting.\r\n\r\nSliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom open directly onto a private deck, perfect for morning coffee, summer BBQs or simply relaxing outdoors. With an easy- care section and thoughtful layout, this home is ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers or investors seeking modern comfort without the upkeep.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love:\r\n\r\n•  3 bedrooms and 2 stylish bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•  Striking cedar and weatherboard exterior with a distinctive architectural roofline\r\n•  Impressive floor-to-ceiling feature window adding natural light and street appeal\r\n•  Two skylights above the modern kitchen\r\n•  Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n•  Sliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom onto the private deck\r\n•  Modern kitchen with quality appliances and stylish finishes\r\n•  Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n•  Separate laundry for added convenience\r\n•  Elevated 178m² (more or less) easy-care section\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n•  Ideal lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n\r\nLocated in the growing Strathmill community, with a local reserve just around the corner and Orewa Beach, schools, shops and cafés all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy visit one home when you can explore several?\r\n\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different layouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nCall Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour – compare multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa. Follow the Strathmill signs.",
